# W058 — the Three.js conformance battery's runtime-only link state.
# This directory is NOT a pnpm workspace package (pnpm-workspace.yaml is
# frozen), so the owning adapter package's link script creates
# node_modules -> ../../../adapters/renderers/threejs/node_modules at test
# time (idempotent; see adapters/renderers/threejs/scripts/link-local.mjs).
# The parent harness's `node_modules` pattern (no trailing slash) covers
# this symlink at any depth; this entry is defensive documentation so the
# link state is never committed.
